1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,750
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,040
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,360
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,170
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 24=

12
00:01:21,779 --> 00:01:22,580
Ziyuan.

13
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:31,100
Li...

14
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,460
I can't hold on much longer.

15
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:41,580
I can't save you.

16
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,699
I can't save Jinan City either.

17
00:01:45,859 --> 00:01:46,699
So...

18
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:49,460
You've lived through nine lifetimes.

19
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:52,380
No wonder there's only
a wisp of your soul left.

20
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:55,740
Ziyuan...

21
00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:58,300
I'm sorry.

22
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:02,979
You must be exhausted
after all these years.

23
00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:12,339
Li,

24
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:16,099
what am I supposed to do

25
00:02:17,020 --> 00:02:18,339
to save you?

26
00:02:23,059 --> 00:02:24,260
I remember now.

27
00:02:25,059 --> 00:02:26,339
I remember everything.

28
00:02:26,819 --> 00:02:27,900
I won't let you bear

29
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:29,580
this endless pain of loss alone anymore.

30
00:02:30,219 --> 00:02:31,140
This time,

31
00:02:31,819 --> 00:02:32,980
let's face it together,

32
00:02:33,779 --> 00:02:34,460
alright?

33
00:02:35,939 --> 00:02:36,860
Alright.

34
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,539
Alright.

35
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:57,580
(Let this be the final exchange.)

36
00:03:04,539 --> 00:03:05,339
Li.

37
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,700
Your eyes are swollen from crying.

38
00:03:27,819 --> 00:03:29,420
These 49 bamboo slips

39
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:32,619
mark the 49-day countdown

40
00:03:34,059 --> 00:03:35,980
and hold memories of our ten lives.

41
00:03:38,140 --> 00:03:39,580
Why didn't you tell me?

42
00:03:41,099 --> 00:03:42,900
You kept all those secrets to yourself.

43
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:45,700
That must've hurt so much.

44
00:03:48,379 --> 00:03:49,260
If I'd told you,

45
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:50,659
you wouldn't have left.

46
00:03:51,379 --> 00:03:52,980
If I couldn't save everyone,

47
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,140
at least I could save you.

48
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:58,260
But this time,

49
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:00,300
I still failed.

50
00:04:02,580 --> 00:04:03,700
Do you really believe

51
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:05,499
I could survive?

52
00:04:09,819 --> 00:04:10,740
That sword...

53
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:13,219
it hurt, didn't it?

54
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,779
If we fail again

55
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,779
this time,

56
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:25,859
you'll never have another chance
to be reborn.

57
00:04:26,539 --> 00:04:27,380
I know.

58
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:31,859
I failed again.

59
00:04:32,219 --> 00:04:33,900
Am I really that useless?

60
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:37,219
Then this time,

61
00:04:38,219 --> 00:04:39,539
let's face it together.

62
00:04:41,299 --> 00:04:42,299
And if we fail...

63
00:04:43,940 --> 00:04:45,099
We die together.

64
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:16,060
Judging by the timing of past cycles,

65
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:18,419
the sacrificial ceremony
should be today.

66
00:05:18,779 --> 00:05:20,500
The day the city falls is also today.

67
00:05:20,940 --> 00:05:22,460
Why is it so quiet today?

68
00:05:27,979 --> 00:05:29,580
The Shaman Clan is due east.

69
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:32,140
Huancai Pavilion is due south.

70
00:05:33,299 --> 00:05:34,299
Zhong Jiang's brick kiln

71
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:35,419
is due west.

72
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:37,940
The moonflower and the locust tree

73
00:05:38,099 --> 00:05:39,060
are due north.

74
00:05:40,099 --> 00:05:41,700
These four bamboo slips combined

75
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:43,900
form the
Four Directions Soul-Severing Formation.

76
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,140
You figured it out only now?

77
00:05:57,500 --> 00:05:58,859
How disappointing.

78
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:00,419
Fusheng?

79
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:05,779
And me.

80
00:06:06,219 --> 00:06:07,060
Lanruo?

81
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:08,539
You're not dead?

82
00:06:08,979 --> 00:06:10,460
How could I die?

83
00:06:10,659 --> 00:06:12,580
- We two are one and the same.
- We two are one and the same.

84
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:14,700
- How could we die so easily?
- How could we die so easily?

85
00:06:16,739 --> 00:06:17,779
They say the Qin State

86
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:19,700
has a shaman
with one soul in two bodies.

87
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:21,179
Today,

88
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:22,460
I've seen it for myself.

89
00:06:22,859 --> 00:06:23,659
Chu Li,

90
00:06:24,659 --> 00:06:26,979
your Chu Phoenix Call
has caused me no end of trouble.

91
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:29,539
Fortunately, I sensed
something was wrong in my previous life.

92
00:06:29,779 --> 00:06:30,979
That's how I discovered...

93
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:32,339
You had reset

94
00:06:32,339 --> 00:06:33,940
time for all of us.

95
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:36,700
Luckily, I kept my memories
from the previous life.

96
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,900
This time around,

97
00:06:38,539 --> 00:06:40,500
I'm going to rewrite the ending.

98
00:06:40,739 --> 00:06:42,859
I set up the
Four Directions Soul-Severing Formation.

99
00:06:43,339 --> 00:06:45,580
I've used people's desires
to feed its core.

100
00:06:45,859 --> 00:06:47,979
The moonflower's obsession,
Zhong Jiang's delusion,

101
00:06:48,099 --> 00:06:50,940
Ning Ji's wrath, Yaohua's fixation...

102
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:52,219
Yaohua's fixation

103
00:06:52,339 --> 00:06:55,099
completed the final link of the
Four Directions Soul-Severing Formation.

104
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:57,099
From now on,

105
00:06:57,580 --> 00:06:58,940
the Qin Army can't get in.

106
00:06:59,299 --> 00:07:00,219
And none of you

107
00:07:01,339 --> 00:07:04,140
can get out of Jinan City.

108
00:07:06,419 --> 00:07:09,659
I'll sever Jinan City
from the world's cycle of rebirth

109
00:07:09,859 --> 00:07:11,900
and make it my own empire.

110
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:13,620
What right do these commoners have

111
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:16,380
to rule over us shamans?

112
00:07:16,979 --> 00:07:17,820
Chu Li,

113
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:19,580
only you

114
00:07:20,179 --> 00:07:21,419
deserve to

115
00:07:21,979 --> 00:07:23,580
rule this world with me.

116
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:26,500
Ziyuan spent ten lives

117
00:07:26,779 --> 00:07:27,859
trying to save all this.

118
00:07:28,979 --> 00:07:30,659
I will never let you succeed!

119
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:46,700
Song Ziyuan,

120
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:47,979
once you're dead,

121
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:49,620
Chu Li will still be mine.

122
00:08:37,299 --> 00:08:37,980
Ziyuan!

123
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:56,900
Chu Li,

124
00:08:57,299 --> 00:08:58,860
I was kind enough to spare your life,

125
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,779
but you don't know what's good for you.

126
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:04,140
Then you and Song Ziyuan

127
00:09:04,779 --> 00:09:06,900
will have your souls torn apart!

128
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:39,100
It's too late.

129
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:41,980
Once the Four Directions
Soul-Severing Formation is broken,

130
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:44,579
the Qin Army will storm into Jinan City.

131
00:09:45,380 --> 00:09:46,299
You

132
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:48,380
and all of Jinan City

133
00:09:49,779 --> 00:09:51,620
will go down with me!

134
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:09,020
Li...

135
00:10:10,340 --> 00:10:11,380
I'm sorry.

136
00:10:12,659 --> 00:10:14,699
I still couldn't save you.

137
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:17,620
Ziyuan...

138
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:20,059
You will live.

139
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:23,179
What are you going to do?

140
00:10:24,819 --> 00:10:25,939
Didn't Mother say

141
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:28,980
I still have one chance
to summon the Chu Phoenix Call?

142
00:10:29,819 --> 00:10:30,659
But

143
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:32,579
I can only go through one more cycle.

144
00:10:34,059 --> 00:10:35,740
Actually, while you were unconscious,

145
00:10:36,299 --> 00:10:37,740
I already summoned the Chu Phoenix Call

146
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:40,980
and offered my soul in exchange.

147
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:44,900
Tomorrow, the Qin Army
will take another route into Jinan City

148
00:10:45,419 --> 00:10:46,539
and slaughter its people.

149
00:10:47,659 --> 00:10:49,779
The King's personal guards
will witness it all

150
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:51,380
and send word to the King.

151
00:10:52,659 --> 00:10:54,299
The King will order the capital moved.

152
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:56,140
By then,

153
00:10:58,179 --> 00:11:00,260
you and the 300,000 people of Jinan City

154
00:11:01,059 --> 00:11:02,220
will all survive.

155
00:11:03,140 --> 00:11:04,140
Li...

156
00:11:05,140 --> 00:11:06,100
My fate

157
00:11:06,980 --> 00:11:08,539
was decided the day I was born.

158
00:11:08,662 --> 00:11:10,222
♪Don't stand alone in the moonlit tower♪

159
00:11:10,222 --> 00:11:11,299
Reversing time,

160
00:11:11,939 --> 00:11:13,220
cycling through ten lives,

161
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:15,699
all to save Jinan City

162
00:11:15,699 --> 00:11:17,179
and its 300,000 people.

163
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:20,779
But in the fate already written for me,

164
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:22,539
I met you.

165
00:11:24,059 --> 00:11:24,900
In this life,

166
00:11:26,419 --> 00:11:27,500
I have no regrets.

167
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:31,100
Li...

168
00:11:31,203 --> 00:11:33,003
♪Ask not what kind of love this is♪

169
00:11:33,900 --> 00:11:34,860
I have to go.

170
00:11:35,419 --> 00:11:36,299
Li,

171
00:11:36,699 --> 00:11:37,459
don't do this.

172
00:11:38,020 --> 00:11:38,740
Ziyuan...

173
00:11:38,844 --> 00:11:40,771
♪Don't stand alone in the moonlit tower♪

174
00:11:41,059 --> 00:11:43,299
In that life, what were the last words

175
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:45,059
you said to me?

176
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:49,659
(Forget me.)

177
00:11:49,772 --> 00:11:53,372
♪Ask not what my heart feels♪

178
00:11:56,179 --> 00:11:57,299
Then remember this, too...

179
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:59,120
♪My heart is a lonely fortress,
locking love's vines inside♪

180
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,159
Forget me.

181
00:12:01,873 --> 00:12:04,333
♪Locking away a lifetime♪

182
00:12:04,979 --> 00:12:09,332
♪Ask not whether love
is madness or bone-deep pain♪

183
00:12:09,532 --> 00:12:15,483
♪Your smile reflected in another's cup♪

184
00:12:17,368 --> 00:12:19,742
♪Another's cup♪

185
00:12:19,742 --> 00:12:21,179
(Song Ziyuan, what are you doing?)

186
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:22,779
(Why are you doing this?)

187
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:24,059
(Song Ziyuan!)

188
00:12:24,299 --> 00:12:25,579
(Song Ziyuan, no!)

189
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:26,900
No!

190
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:29,140
No!

191
00:12:31,260 --> 00:12:34,299
No!

192
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:42,059
No!

193
00:12:43,659 --> 00:12:45,459
No!

194
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:52,980
No!

195
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,183
(278 BC: Bai Qi's Capture of Ying)

196
00:12:54,183 --> 00:12:55,380
(Jinan City fell to Qin general Bai Qi
and was abandoned.)

197
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:56,299
(Forewarned of the attack, the Chu King)
(A day later,)

198
00:12:56,579 --> 00:12:57,779
(led his people to a new capital, Chen.)
(the Qin Army entered the city.)

199
00:12:57,779 --> 00:12:58,579
(Though Chu State was gravely weakened,)

200
00:12:58,579 --> 00:12:59,500
(its people survived.)
(By then,)

201
00:12:59,699 --> 00:13:02,140
(the Chu royal family
had led 300,000 people)

202
00:13:02,659 --> 00:13:04,059
(out of Jinan City.)

203
00:13:14,299 --> 00:13:15,980
(He gave up ever being reborn)

204
00:13:16,419 --> 00:13:17,779
(so I could have a new life.)

205
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:21,179
(My soul took residence in his body.)

206
00:13:21,939 --> 00:13:23,059
(From then on,)

207
00:13:23,419 --> 00:13:24,579
(the wind I touch,)

208
00:13:25,059 --> 00:13:26,299
(the light I feel...)

209
00:13:26,579 --> 00:13:27,779
(he shares them all.)

210
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:30,539
(My smiles and my tears)

211
00:13:31,539 --> 00:13:32,699
(wear his face.)

212
00:13:32,743 --> 00:13:36,863
(Fifty Years Later)

213
00:13:56,419 --> 00:13:57,059
Shiqi,

214
00:13:57,539 --> 00:13:58,459
help me write something.

215
00:13:58,860 --> 00:13:59,659
Yes, Master.

216
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:00,699
What shall I write?

217
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:03,620
The story is called

218
00:14:05,140 --> 00:14:06,179
"Seeing Jinan City

219
00:14:07,020 --> 00:14:08,340
Again."

220
00:14:08,447 --> 00:14:11,987
♪Moonlight spills over
gray tiles and walls♪

221
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:16,300
♪Wind chimes sway, evoking old times♪

222
00:14:16,645 --> 00:14:18,552
♪You come treading through snow♪

223
00:14:18,618 --> 00:14:23,828
♪Twin butterfly shadows in my palm♪

224
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:27,994
♪Red threads wind through a few lines
of the book of fate♪

225
00:14:28,124 --> 00:14:31,800
♪Yet one passionate look undoes it all♪

226
00:14:32,081 --> 00:14:34,408
♪No mountain or sea can bar the way♪

227
00:14:34,474 --> 00:14:38,913
♪I'd burn through every lifetime
to be with you♪

228
00:14:38,939 --> 00:14:39,939
Come on, everyone, follow me.

229
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:40,980
Watch your step.

230
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:44,860
Today I'll be showing you

231
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:47,380
the exhibition
of Chu State's historical relics.

232
00:14:52,459 --> 00:14:53,699
This is the most iconic

233
00:14:53,779 --> 00:14:55,659
musical instrument of the Chu State,

234
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:57,699
the Tiger-Seat Bird-Frame Bronze Drum.

235
00:14:58,419 --> 00:14:59,939
Everyone, follow me and look this way.

236
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:01,779
Come on.

237
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:05,459
These are bamboo slips unearthed

238
00:15:05,459 --> 00:15:07,779
from the Jinan City ruins
in Jingzhou, Hubei.

239
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:09,779
According to archaeological research,

240
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:12,179
they record an ancient

241
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:14,020
and legendary love story.

242
00:15:14,779 --> 00:15:16,459
Everyone, follow me this way.

243
00:15:22,075 --> 00:15:25,375
(Introduction: Exhibition
of Chu State's 800-Year Civilization)

244
00:15:30,940 --> 00:15:37,690
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

245
00:15:38,100 --> 00:15:44,770
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

246
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:48,460
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

247
00:15:48,630 --> 00:15:51,830
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

248
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:58,820
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

249
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,620
♪Through boundless grief,♪
(800 Years of Chu Civilization Exhibit)

250
00:16:01,620 --> 00:16:05,900
♪love remains hard to sever♪
(800 Years of Chu Civilization Exhibit)

251
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:12,550
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

252
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:13,980
♪That year,♪
(Intro: Phoenix Dances on Mount Jing)

253
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:16,150
♪pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪
(Intro: Phoenix Dances on Mount Jing)

254
00:16:16,410 --> 00:16:19,630
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

255
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:22,740
♪All perfection in this world♪

256
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:26,550
♪hides regret♪
(The End)

257
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:30,430
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

258
00:16:30,590 --> 00:16:34,150
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

259
00:16:34,550 --> 00:16:40,990
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

260
00:17:09,900 --> 00:17:16,570
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

261
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:23,110
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

262
